WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:09.762
Hi! Posters, flyers and notices are full of information. Today we'll learn to find answers quickly.

2
00:00:09.912 --> 00:00:17.346
First read the title and big words: a fun fair on Saturday 5 June, from 9 a.m. to 1 p.m.

3
00:00:17.496 --> 00:00:22.002
Tickets cost two dollars, and children under five go free.

4
00:00:22.152 --> 00:00:24.594
Bring your own water bottle.

5
00:00:24.744 --> 00:00:29.514
Read the small print too: no pets allowed.

6
00:00:29.664 --> 00:00:34.650
Read the question first and circle key words: When? How much?

7
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:38.538
Go back to the poster and scan for that key word.

8
00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:42.282
Small print and stars often hide answers.

9
00:00:42.432 --> 00:00:47.898
Some questions need counting: how much for two tickets?

10
00:00:48.048 --> 00:00:53.202
Watch out! How long asks how much time, not what time it starts!

11
00:00:53.352 --> 00:00:56.946
From 9 a.m. to 1 p.m. is four hours.

12
00:00:57.096 --> 00:01:02.754
Read the key words in the question carefully, then find the answer.

13
00:01:02.904 --> 00:01:10.866
Your turn! On which day is the fun fair? Pause and think.

14
00:01:11.016 --> 00:01:16.650
The notice says Saturday 5 June. Did you get it right?

15
00:01:16.800 --> 00:01:25.218
Another one! How much do two tickets cost? Pause and think.

16
00:01:25.368 --> 00:01:31.698
One is two dollars, so two cost four dollars. Did you get it right?

17
00:01:31.848 --> 00:01:40.962
Here's another! Tom is four. How much does he pay? Pause and think.

18
00:01:41.112 --> 00:01:47.274
Under five is free, so he pays nothing. Did you get it right?

19
00:01:47.424 --> 00:01:55.386
Try one more! What should visitors bring? Pause and think.

20
00:01:55.536 --> 00:02:01.386
The notice says bring your own water bottle. Did you get it right?

21
00:02:01.536 --> 00:02:09.426
Try one more! Can Mei bring her dog? Pause and think.

22
00:02:09.576 --> 00:02:15.834
The small print says no pets allowed, so no. Did you get it right?

23
00:02:15.984 --> 00:02:23.850
Try one more! Who can enter for free? Pause and think.

24
00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:30.210
The notice says children under five go in free. Did you get it right?

25
00:02:30.360 --> 00:02:38.394
Last one! What is the date of the fun fair? Pause and think.

26
00:02:38.544 --> 00:02:44.178
The notice says Saturday 5 June. Did you get it right?

27
00:02:44.328 --> 00:02:53.034
Remember: read the question, circle key words, then scan the text. Check the small print and stars, and count when needed.

28
00:02:53.184 --> 00:02:59.778
Next time you see a poster, quiz yourself: when, where, and how much?

